    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1168">

                <pb facs="1256" n="1160" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1160"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Assis-Brasil to Mr. Day</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States of Brazil</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Block Island</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-07-22"><hi rendition="#italic">July 22,
                                1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your excellency’s note of the 15th instant, containing some suggestions
                    respecting the naval observances for neutral men-of-war in ports now blockaded
                    or which may hereafter be blockaded by the American Navy during the war with
                    Spain. I shall transmit a copy of said note to my Government.</p>
                <p>Accept, sir, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. F. de, Assis-Brasil.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
